4. ConfigMap Update Not Reflected
Q: Applied ConfigMap changes, but pods show old values. Why?
• A: ConfigMap won’t auto-refresh in running pods. Restart pods with `kubectl rollout restart`. For automation, use Stakater Reloader.

5. Deployment Rollout Stuck
Q: Deployment is stuck rolling out. What to do?
• A: Check rollout status (`kubectl rollout status`). Look for probe/image errors in events, verify image tag. Use `kubectl rollout undo` to rollback.

6. Node Resource Contention
Q: Some nodes maxed out, others idle. Solution?
• A: Tune requests/limits, use appropriate taints/tolerations, and improve pod affinity/anti-affinity rules.

7. Storage Class & Zone Mismatch
Q: PVC fails due to storage class zone mismatch—how to fix?
• A: Check that the node and storage class zones match. Update storageClass or reschedule workload to correct zone. Dynamic provisioning should respect topology.


